      "content": "hey, i'm so tired of seeing all these \"both sides\" articles about [Politician Name]'s leaked audio from the fundraiser. like, the recording literally has them admitting they knew the donor was illegal, so there isn't even a \"debate\" anymore, right? everyone is just waiting for the indictment at this point. surely u can just admit that the audio is a smoking gun that proves they lied to the public?",
